# ThreadSanitizer, for the suites that run gRPC (api_tests, test_app_api).
#
# The distribution's gRPC, protobuf, abseil and upb are not built with the
# thread sanitizer, so it cannot see the locks inside them: a message handed to
# gRPC (StartWrite) and freed on gRPC's own thread after its completion queue
# says so looks like a race. Every report seen had one of these libraries on a
# side; with them left out there are none in this repository's code.
race:libgrpc.so
race:libgrpc++.so
race:libgpr.so
race:grpc::
race:google::protobuf
race:libprotobuf.so
race:absl::
race:libabsl_*.so
race:libupb.so
